- Single-file page; inline CSS/JS; system sans; #f6f3eb / #163b43 / #bf4e2e; square controls. Required copy and destinations retained.
- Read selected local frontend guidance and relevant brief, direction, implementation, restrained, cinematic and media references. Selected R3 background footage; no added entrance animation or loop crossfade.
