- Responsive rules target 375/768/1440 and short landscape; no fixed viewport-height layout. Keyboard focus styles and named playback control provided.
- Browser/runtime behavior, actual crop, codec playback, loop continuity, focus and rendered responsive states are unverified; central observer owns qualification. No browser, server, installation, external call or secondary verification workflow used.
EOF"

